{
  "_comment": [
    "License identifier for every package named in bun.lock or tools/ts/bun.lock,",
    "so scripts/sbom.py can stamp a CycloneDX `licenses` field offline and",
    "deterministically. bun.lock records no license field, and without this the",
    "release SBOM named 159 of 169 components with no license at all -- including",
    "MPL-2.0 lightningcss and Apache-2.0 binaryen, which are dev-only but are the",
    "kind of grant a downstream scanner has to be able to read.",
    "Entries are the SPDX id each package's own package.json declares.",
    "scripts/test_sbom.py fails when a lockfile gains a package this file lacks,",
    "so a dependency bump cannot silently ship unlicensed."
  ],
